  "description": "The fog closes in and you can't see far ahead. Trust the markers: the ski lift pylons run along the route, cairns mark the safe line, and the signs warn of what's coming before you can see it. A drop, a gully, a kicker and a step-up are hidden in the white. Ride at a speed that lets you react.",
  "lesson": "Fog limits how far ahead you can see, so signs and props mark the route.",
  "alsoNew": "Heavier snow, the ski lift.",
